      "value": "APB register file for SPI configuration and data transfer",
      "explanation": "The module decodes APB read/write transactions to access SPI control and data registers, mapping PADDR to register selects (SPI_SR, SPI_DR, SPI_CR1) and generating read strobes (SR_r, DR_r, CR1_r) and write strobes (DR_w, CR1_w). It outputs PRDATA from internal rdata during reads and drives PREADY and PSLVERR as constant 1 and 0 respectively, indicating zero-wait-state, always-okay APB responses.",
